<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore shares seen drifting sideways.</title>
<headline>Singapore shares seen drifting sideways.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore shares are expected to drift sideways in quiet dealings on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dealers said general market sentiment was still a bit soft.</p>
<p>&quot;There has not been any good news for the market lately. So it is difficult for the shares to move up,&quot; said one dealer.</p>
<p>The Straits Times Industrial Index closed 1.51 points lower at 2,103.20 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Doreen Siow 65-8703092</p>
